cck-shared
==========

Shared configuration and design tokens for CCK projects. This package ships the
following third-party material.

Fonts
-----
Big Noodle Titling (regular and oblique)
Copyright (c) James Arboghast / Sentinel Type
https://www.myfonts.com/collections/big-noodle-titling-font-sentinel-type

Freeware font, free for personal and commercial use per the author's notice.
Shipped in fonts/ for the club's own projects. The original font files were
converted to WOFF2 for web delivery; the glyphs are unmodified. The font is not
sold or redistributed on its own. Big Noodle Titling is a trademark of James
Arboghast / Sentinel Type.

